house, I am the hero.

00:01:23.854 --> 00:01:25.126
But not here.

00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:27.130
Well, this is a virtual version

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:29.594
of the classic 19th
century game, Charades.

00:01:29.594 --> 00:01:31.070
Maya and I will take turns

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.760
trying to get the other
to say a word or phrase.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.270
The catch is, we will be on mute.

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:36.533
So we can't hear each other.

00:01:36.533 --> 00:01:37.800
Since we're on mute,

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.710
we're allowed to say the words,
use motions and use props.

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:44.336
If we want to pass, we
hold up our pass card.

00:01:44.336 --> 00:01:48.400
If we can get a total of six
words correct in two rounds,

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.320
everyone in our house
seats will win a prize.

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:51.720
